WEBVTT

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.140
Begin loading the Echo Device!

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:33.860
Finis...

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.200
we'll finally meet.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.490
That man...

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.580
Is he their boss?

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.710
Yeah. That's General Bazra Bearmors.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:47.580
The Supreme Commander
of the Capital Army.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.540
I don't like his face.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:53.470
He's forcing people to be weapons.
That's terrible...

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:57.090
Capital Army soldiers have
never even seen Finis.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.720
I mean, we just saw her
for the first time ourselves.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:02.850
-What did you just say?
-Huh?

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.390
The soldiers have never even seen her?

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.440
That's what they said, right?

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:11.150
Finis is here, right?

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:15.110
I haven't seen her yet.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.030
Does she even exist?

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.700
I heard she's a songstress
with miraculous power.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.740
You're right. They did say that.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.080
In other words,

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.920
only a few of the guards have seen Finis.

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:29.670
That means...

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.800
this is worth betting on.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.680
The Star Song Festival is almost here.
We'll go back to the Capital.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.060
The Song of Nostalgia

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.190
We've finished deploying
the Symphony Killer.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:18.650
Granadia is going to regret
ever starting a war with us.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.280
This has nothing to do with me.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:22.780
Don't be silly.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.160
We'll have you continue

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:29.000
to sing as a weapon
of The Kingdom of Golt.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.250
You're going to let me sing
with the Court Orchestra

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.880
at the Star Song Festival.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.380
That was our agreement.

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:40.880
Aside from that, you're going to be
a Weapon of Song and follow my orders.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.890
That was our agreement.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:48.140
You said that singing
the Song of Mortality

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.980
has the power to destroy
an entire country,

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:54.520
-and there's only one chance to use it.
-Yes.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.900
We can't lose that chance.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:01.110
We need your songs to take over the world.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:06.780
As long as you uphold our agreement,
I'm fine with that.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.290
What a strange woman.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.370
-Hey.
-Yes, sir!

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:20.050
How is the Court Orchestra in the Capital?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.260
Yes, sir.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:25.140
We're ready to get rid of them
anytime you give the order.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.930
But why do it?

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:32.310
I can't tell why that woman cares so much
about the festival and the orchestra.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.940
We need to be careful.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.980
<i>What do you mean, bet on it?</i>

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.940
Most of the Capital Army soldiers have
never seen Finis.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:46.620
So, if someone approached them
while pretending to be Finis,

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.160
-no one would notice.
-You're right.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.330
But why do you want to pretend
to be Finis?

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:53.830
To steal that.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:59.130
-The Symphony Killer.
-We're going to steal that weapon?!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.760
We're going to cause a commotion
and save Finis

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.010
while everyone is preoccupied.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:12.640
You're amazing, Pony! Only an elder could
think of an idea like that.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.560
Did you just say I'm wise
like a grandmother?!

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.020
But...

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:22.150
Hey.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:25.700
I should be the one to pretend
to be Finis, right?

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:28.070
You're such an idiot.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.580
You shouldn't go, Rin.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.620
Why? Because we don't look alike?

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:38.170
The Capital Army is trying to capture you.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.750
Or did you forget?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.590
You just stay back and hide.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:48.050
We'll steal that thing
and bring Finis back.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.510
-But...
-Rin.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.600
I don't gamble
if there's no chance of winning.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.850
Leave it to me once in a while, okay?

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.310
Well, then, here's the plan.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.400
<i>When we get to the Symphony Killer,</i>

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:11.410
<i>we're going to tell the guards</i>
<i>that we've brought Finis.</i>

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.370
<i>How will we get them to believe us?</i>

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.330
<i>By using this.</i>

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.000
What's that?

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.960
Dr. Weissen gave it to me.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.550
It's loaded with the Song of Wind.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:25.130
Seriously?

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:29.130
Whoever impersonates Finis will sing
the Song of Wind,

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:33.760
and we'll secretly release the power
of the song from this Echo Device.

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:35.100
I get it.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:38.600
The impersonator will look
like she has the power of songs.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:41.020
Hey. Who's going to play Finis?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.480
Well...

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:46.690
Huh...?

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:55.620
<i>As long as the guards believe us,</i>
<i>we'll gain access to the Symphony Killer.</i>

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:58.750
<i>All that remains is to cause</i>
<i>a commotion and save Finis.</i>

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.790
What if they capture us?

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:04.040
They'll chop us into pieces.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.170
Really tiny pieces.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.710
It'll be okay.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.010
I have a backup plan.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.730
Wait for us, Finis.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.150
I heard...

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.150
a song...

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.490
Who are you?!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.290
We've brought Miss Finis.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.200
What?

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:40.580
What's wrong?

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.710
They said they've brought Miss Finis.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.500
Did you say Finis?

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.420
-That woman who sings?
-Yeah, probably...

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:51.010
If anyone here has seen Finis before,
we're doomed.

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.680
-Any word from General Bazra?
-No.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.090
-Guess you're right.
-Hey--

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:58.180
Hey! Are you sure
that the one in the back is Finis?

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.640
Huh? Oh, yeah. Of course.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.690
Finis is supposed to be brought here
by General Bazra.

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.810
Yes, but the plans have changed.

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:09.820
She wants to get on the Symphony Killer
and check something.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:14.320
We haven't heard anything about that!
Wait here until we check with Bazra.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.410
-Hey, you. Hurry and check.
-Yes, sir.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.870
<i>The name of the wind</i>

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:29.420
<i>The name of the wind</i>

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.550
Stop, Miss Finis!

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:33.550
Are you angry?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.090
<i>If you call</i>
<i>The wind will answer</i>

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.350
What are you singing?!

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.140
<i>The name of the wind</i>

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.930
What are we going to do?!

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.560
-I have no idea.
-Hey!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.520
If we just hit this thing...

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.360
<i>The name of the wind</i>
<i>Sweeps over the land</i>

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:52.030
What's going on?!

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.950
<i>And carries all away</i>

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:57.120
<i>LAI-LA LAI-LA</i>
<i>A cry that defies</i>

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.580
What's going on?!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.740
No! Miss Finis is upset!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.830
<i>LAI-LA LAI-LA</i>
<i>At the end of the storm</i>

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.460
You'll all be blown away!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.170
Wait. We'll do what you say.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.170
Stop singing!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.170
<i>You will be swallowed up and disappear</i>
<i>At the wind's will</i>

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:17.140
So, this is the power of songs...

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.100
Do you understand now, you slaves?

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:24.850
You've gone too far.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.110
Anyway, you're fine with it, right?

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:30.940
All right.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:34.360
Take Miss Finis to the Symphony Killer.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.290
Hey. You guys wait here.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:45.080
Why?!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.370
We have orders not to let anyone

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.880
except General Bazra and Miss Finis
onboard under any circumstances.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.210
No exceptions!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:58.840
This is bad.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.310
The carriage was over here, right?

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.110
A sword?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:24.080
No!

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.750
Was that--? Finis?

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.010
Black spirits...

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.730
I can hear a song...

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:03.870
<i>How can you say that?</i>

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:07.250
<i>I sang that song for the people...</i>

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:11.330
<i>All you have to do is use the power</i>
<i>of your songs.</i>

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:16.880
<i>In order to create something new,</i>
<i>my songs take something in exchange.</i>

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:20.800
<i>Why didn't you say something earlier?!</i>
<i>You shouldn't have... Just for me...</i>

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:22.390
Is this...

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.850
Finis's past?

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.810
<i>You protected me with your life.</i>

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:32.440
<i>So...</i>

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:36.020
<i>I wanted to sing for you.</i>

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.030
<i>Finis...</i>

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:49.750
Mr. Leobolt?!

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.710
You're terrible. Why are you doing this?

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:06.470
Wait! Wait, Finis! That song is--

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:10.680
<i>Everything should just disappear.</i>

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.490
<i>The Song of Mortality...</i>

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:35.330
Allu...

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.090
I can't keep this up...

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.840
any longer.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.640
-What?!
-It's moving!

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:49.970
Monica...

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.310
Did General Bazra order this?!

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:54.520
Hey! What's going on?!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:57.150
Those movements... That girl is sleeping!

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.860
Our plan was to cause a commotion, but...

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:02.070
-Check with the general!
-Yes, sir!

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:11.580
Damn! What's going on?!

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.730
What an amazing destructive force.

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:39.520
If it keeps shooting at random,
we won't last a second!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:43.070
-In any case, we have to stop Monica.
-How?!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.280
You tricked us!

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.990
Kill them! Stop the kid onboard, too!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.080
This is bad! This is bad!

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:20.400
Wait!

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:22.440
Catch them!

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.070
Monica! Wake up!

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.740
All right! I caught her--

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.120
Monica!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.010
What's happening?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:03.190
<i>Finis's past...</i>

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:08.990
<i>Even though the world was destroyed,</i>
<i>you kept on living.</i>

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.620
<i>What all have you lived through?</i>

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.120
<i>What were you thinking about?</i>

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.540
<i>Hey, tell me.</i>

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.890
<i>I'll listen to everything.</i>

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:43.520
My first impression of her...

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:46.860
was that she was beautiful.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:48.820
I don't remember...

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.860
when or where...

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.740
she came from anymore.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:57.990
-Huh? Finis, right? I know her.
-We're in the same class.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:01.210
She didn't look any different.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.960
She hadn't aged one bit
since the day we first met.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.420
<i>I see.</i>

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:12.470
I don't know what happened after that.
She was gone soon afterwards.

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:15.430
<i>She's lived while history repeated itself</i>
<i>again and again.</i>

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.220
You... monster!

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.940
<i>She's been scared.</i>

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:24.980
Witch!

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:27.570
She's an immortal witch!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.030
Burn her! Make her burn in hell forever!

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.650
<i>She's suffered eternally.</i>

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:43.080
<i>A song that awakens and calls...</i>

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.290
<i>People repeat the song</i>

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.920
<i>In their hearts</i>

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:52.920
Where am I?

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:58.970
<i>I wish to shine love into the sky</i>

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:04.480
<i>From which the light has disappeared</i>

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:08.650
She never forgot.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:10.690
<i>On the journey of no end</i>

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:13.950
She never forgot about
the first Mr. Leobolt she met.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.870
<i>Everyone</i>

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:22.950
<i>Is searching</i>

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:28.880
<i>For the meaning of this life</i>

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:35.010
I see. To Finis,
the Song of Healing represents...

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:45.480
I thought that...
the power of songs was only a legend.

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:46.850
Bazra!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.500
Everything will be destroyed.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.000
With the power of your songs,

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.460
I'm going to rule the world.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.920
-Stop!
-To me, the Song of Healing represents...

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:17.090
hope, my feelings for him.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.180
Finis.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.800
That's why I threw it away.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:27.270
-Hey! They ran this way!
-Don't let them get away!

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:34.030
Unless I throw away my feelings for him,

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.940
I can't sing the Song of Mortality.

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:40.360
I don't need hope.

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:42.740
Why?

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:44.830
There they are!

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.620
We found you!

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:48.960
They're unarmed.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.830
Sing for me, woman.

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:54.130
Unless you want to be killed.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:59.800
The Star Song Festival is almost here.
Everything will finally be over.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:04.060
<i>As the flame burns, a fleeting heartbeat</i>
<i>As the flame burns</i>

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.060
What's she doing?!

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.470
<i>Memories melt together</i>

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.310
No way! Finis!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.310
<i>Be a flame that swallows everything</i>

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.270
No! Wait!

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:15.730
<i>My dear flame</i>

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:23.370
Wonderful. This is wonderful!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.120
She really is a goddess!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.380
It's going to fall!

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:46.390
Seriously?!

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.100
Monica!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.650
Monica! Wake up!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:55.770
You! Kill the girl!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:57.400
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:00.650
Stop!

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.160
What--?

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.290
-Is it the Granadia Army?
-No, it's not!

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:17.090
You fools of the Capital Army!

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:20.840
You girls are putting on quite a show.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:24.760
Get on. We're on your side.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.160
The Song of Healing
that Finis threw away...

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.050
What does this mean?

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.880
Who's there?

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.890
What's a baby doing here?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:12.060
Poor thing...

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:30.280
Wait! Are you really on our side?!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.700
Yeah. Haven't you seen this flag before?

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.250
Is that...?

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.380
Leobolt, the hottie?!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.590
He's our leader!

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.940
Stop right there... Bazra Bearmors.

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:04.110
You should have died already... Leobolt.

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:11.160
Leobolt...

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:14.620
Finis. I've come to save you.

